      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this gorgeous 3 bed, 3 bath terraced house to the rental market, located at Church Gardens, Rathmines, Dublin 6.\nFinished to a high standard throughout, this pet-friendly home comes with two double bedrooms and one single, and three bathrooms including a downstairs WC, an ensuite and the main bathroom. There is a private outdoor area to the rear, on-street parking to the front, and the property is ready to move into immediately.\nRathmines is one of Dublin's most popular southside neighbourhoods, with Rathmines Road's shops, cafes and restaurants right on its' doorstep, along with Palmerston Park and the wider Ranelagh and Rathgar areas close by.\nFor public transport, Rathmines is served by several bus routes into the city centre, while Ranelagh Luas stop on the Green Line is a short walk away. Dublin city centre is roughly a 15 minute drive or cycle, or about a 35 minute walk.\n1.Fully furnished\n2.3 bedrooms (2 double, 1 single)\n3.3 bathrooms, including downstairs WC and ensuite\n4.Finished to a high standard throughout\n5.On-street parking\n6.Private outdoor area to the rear\n7.Pet friendly\n8.Various Dublin Bus routes into the city centre and surrounding areas\n9.Ranelagh Luas stop a short walk away\nENQUIRIES BY EMAIL ONLY PLEASE.\n"
      },
